msgid "Light Shield"
msgstr "Light Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/light-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Light Shield gives the OpenMV Cam nine high-power white LEDs driven by a"
" TPS61169 LED driver, with brightness controllable from the camera over PWM."
msgstr ""
"Il Light Shield fornisce all'OpenMV Cam nove LED bianchi ad alta potenza "
"pilotati da un driver LED TPS61169, con luminosità controllabile dalla "
"camera tramite PWM."

